␀Ğ7#1  ~(€2C12-C2-SŠ=@ª•ª•ª•ª•␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ„öe÷␀	Info␀ß		Game	Options;␀␀␀␀The aimu␀␀Movingx␀␀Fighting1␀␀Things¢␀␀More commands0␀␀The screen<␀␀Saving:S␀Save game:ƒL␀Level map<N␀Mini mapÔ„R␀Redraw screenÜ…Q␀Quitó†␀Stairs up1␀Your name8␀Rogue 5.4.4 by Michael Toy, Ken Arnold and Glenn Wichman.Find the Amulet of Yendor (below level 26) and bring it backto the surface. The Info topic of the MENU tells you how toplay.Z88 version by Jamie Bradbury, 2026.␀Moving, fighting, things, the screen and saving.␀Save, see the whole level, redraw or quit.␀Stairs that lead up too, and your name for the tombstone.␀Rooms are joined by passages. Find the stairs (%) and press >to go down. Gold, potions, scrolls, rings, wands, armour andweapons lie about; monsters (letters) get stronger deeperdown. With the Amulet, < goes back up (or always, with Stairsup in Options).␀Cursor keys or h j k l (y u b n diagonally) move. - and adirection runs; + and a cursor key runs until something turnsup. s searches for hidden doors and traps; > and < usestairs.␀Walk into a monster to hit it. F and a direction fights tothe death; t throws, z zaps a wand. Rest (.) to heal.␀i lists what you carry. q quaff, r read, e eat, w wield, Wwear, T take off armour, P put on, R remove a ring, d drop, ccall (name) a thing.␀/ names a symbol. m and a direction moves without picking up;^ and a direction names a trap. , picks up, I shows onething, a repeats a command. ) ] = @ show weapon, armour,rings, state. D lists what you know. +R redraws, +P repeatsthe last message, ESC cancels.␀Messages are on the top line; the map below follows you; yourstate is on the right. M (or +L) shows the whole level, 7rows at a time (j and k move).␀+N: the panel shows the level you have seen; your state is onthe top line, or the panel in a fight.␀S (or +S) saves to rogue.sav and play goes on. Rogue offersthe saved game when it starts; once restored, the file isdeleted. After you die, a new game starts.␀Draw the screen again.␀Give up this game (Rogue asks first). The application closes.␀Choose it to turn it on or off. On, < on the stairs takes youup to a new level (not from the first): a way out of trouble,or to search more levels for food and things. Off, as in theoriginal game, only the Amulet takes you up. It stays setuntil Rogue closes.␀Type your name. DEL rubs out, ENTER finishes, ESC keeps theold one.␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿRG88©êXØÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÃÀ7Éİ~ş€0ş@!ÛÁÚ¦ÁÍ*Á!ÛÁÚ¦Á!␀␀"%yİ!ÿÿ>çH!ÛÁÂ¦Á>ço¯2'y2(yG!ºÁçu!ÃÁçís#yÍÅÀ!ôÁÚ¦Á:ì}Gç]!@±␀ ~#·(útÀO␀í°ñÖG¯üç!î+5M6␀#x± øÍX÷!␀å!ÉÁå!␀␀åÍßÁÁÁ:(y·(>2␀çôİ*%yİ|İµ(çQ¯ç!í{#yÃNÀ!è}6␀#ûçZxÖõÕÍÁÑñ< õÍóÀĞ>ÿõÍÁñ=ş ö!è}~·7È#ù·ÉGWç]!ğ¿	Â¾À#ù~şĞ_␀å!è}ãçZápÉ¯2␀ >@␀␀çN8"ÍoÁ0:␀ o&␀) İåÑs#r!␀ 4~ş8ØÍŒÁ7ÉÕİåÍŒÁİáÑBç]İ"%y·É@␀Õ␀¯çTÑØz·(¸ P ê·É7É!␀ ~·È5o-&␀) ^#VÕİáçQæå!ÍÁç	:áç	:ôçÖ¯ç!ÈşgÊ¡À¯ÉéRogue␀ÃÁ␀␀7#1  ~(€2C1␀Rogue needs more memory.␀Rogue: bank missing.␀RG88©êXØ
